# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Celonis GitHub Packages auth for ems-frontend (@celonis/* scoped packages)
#
# 1. Replace GITHUB_PAT_HERE with a GitHub Personal Access Token (classic)
#    that has the `read:packages` scope (add `repo` too if you also clone
#    private repos over HTTPS).
# 2. Authorize that token for the `celonis` org via SAML SSO (GitHub token
#    page → "Configure SSO" → Authorize for celonis).
# 3. Copy this file to your home directory:
#        cp npmrc.template ~/.npmrc
#    (If you already have a ~/.npmrc, append these two lines to it instead
#    of overwriting it.)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

@celonis:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=GITHUB_PAT_HERE
